  "Overview": "Assassin's Creed: Heritage Collection is a compilation consisting of the main games in the Assassin's Creed series, similar to the previous Anthology bundle released in 2012; the Heritage Collection includes Assassin's Creed, Assassin's Creed II, Assassin's Creed: Brotherhood, Assassin's Creed: Revelations and Assassin's Creed III.\n\nUnlike the Anthology bundle, the Heritage Collection includes no special packaging, extras or DLC for any of the games, and is sold at a much cheaper price.",
